oto sentence."},{"id":9,"weight":2,"a":2,"b":2,"evidence":"Both supply a corrected version of the text as the main output rather than only critique or general advice."},{"id":10,"weight":1,"a":2,"b":2,"evidence":"Both keep the content in a single paragraph with no added paragraph breaks. B splits sentences, which does not change paragraph structure."}],"winner":"B"}
